&lt;div class=&quot;hwp_editor_board_content&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Malgun Gothic&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:120%&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;인천광역시 제물포구는 경제적 취약계층 여성청소년의 건강한 성장과 기본권 보장을 위해 생리용품 구입 비용을 지원하는 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;『&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;여성청소년 보건위생물품&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;생리대&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;바우처 지원사업&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;』&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;을 시행하고 있습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:120%&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:120%&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;본 사업은 청소년들이 부담 없이 위생물품을 구매할 수 있도록 돕는 제도로&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;지원 대상에 해당하면 국민행복카드 바우처 포인트를 통해 원하는 제품&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;생리대&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;탐폰&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;생리컵 등&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;을 자유롭게 구매하실 수 있습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;지원 대상 및 바우처 이용 안내는 아래와 같습니다&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:120%&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:120%&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;○ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;지원 대상 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:120%&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;연령 기준&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;만 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;세 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;~ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;만 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;24&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt&quot;&gt;세 여성청소년 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
